{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blood &amp; Money</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood &amp; Money delivers relentless Gauntlet-style co-op carnage, powered by a raw punk rock soundtrack and retro 256-color art. Join a friend to blast through monster-filled dungeons with fireballs and explosives, grabbing loot in a kingdom torn by a traitor\u2019s pact. Retro action awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921270/extras/6c005375a95845e8d3d62558bdf0cd61.poster.avif?t=1758569317\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921270/extras/6c005375a95845e8d3d62558bdf0cd61.webm?t=1758569317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921270/extras/6c005375a95845e8d3d62558bdf0cd61.mp4?t=1758569317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eons ago, a traitor king\u2019s unholy pact with a dark sorceress unleashed a monstrous plague upon the land, turning a once-proud kingdom into a blood-soaked wasteland. You and your ally must banish these beasts from the cursed islands, wielding fireballs and bombs to reclaim glory. Will you triumph, or join the fallen in the gods\u2019 judgment?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from six characters with unique stats to unleash fireballs, bombs, and an arsenal of potions, spells, and magical items, shredding monsters in fountains of gore. Explore dungeons with fluid, eight-way movement and spend hard-earned coins on stat boosts in shops. Join a friend in two-player co-op to dominate the blood-soaked battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921270/extras/bc64dee719ba5d5496761278c45c6c1c.poster.avif?t=1758569317\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921270/extras/bc64dee719ba5d5496761278c45c6c1c.webm?t=1758569317\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921270/extras/bc64dee719ba5d5496761278c45c6c1c.mp4?t=1758569317\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Piles of coins from shredded enemies fuel your shopping spree with the cigarette girl, a shadowy vendor roaming the cursed kingdom. Grab food, bombs, potions, spellbooks, or magic items, and boost your stats to survive the relentless onslaught of monsters ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921270/extras/70c5a42583bd36808b885460a6cc273c.avif?t=1758569317\" width=480 height=270 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two-Player Co-op Chaos: Team up for local or remote play together, synergizing or stealing loot in blood-soaked dungeons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade-Style Action: Pick-up-and-play controls deliver instant thrills for retro arcade fans.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra-Violent Combat: Obliterate skeletons, zombies, and more with gory, over-the-top kills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stat-Boost Upgrades: Buy speed, power, or durability boosts to customize your hero for the fight ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >256-Color Pixel Art: Gritty, retro-inspired visuals bring vibrant, blood-drenched arenas to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punk Rock Soundtrack: A blistering score fuels every battle, amplifying the chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921270?t=1758569317","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921270?t=1758569317","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921270/e59ff080f082fa953f5d58bf7e079e6ef2641d55/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758569317","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921270/e59ff080f082fa953f5d58bf7e079e6ef2641d55/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758569317","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Cartoon ultra violence."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Blood &amp; Money</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood &amp; Money delivers relentless Gauntlet-style co-op carnage, powered by a raw punk rock soundtrack and retro 256-color art. Join a friend to blast through monster-filled dungeons with fireballs and explosives, grabbing loot in a kingdom torn by a traitor\u2019s pact. Retro action awaits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921270/extras/6c005375a95845e8d3d62558bdf0cd61.