g\" ><strong>Shop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Piles of coins from shredded enemies fuel your shopping spree with the cigarette girl, a shadowy vendor roaming the cursed kingdom. Grab food, bombs, potions, spellbooks, or magic items, and boost your stats to survive the relentless onslaught of monsters ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921270/extras/70c5a42583bd36808b885460a6cc273c.avif?t=1758569317\" width=480 height=270 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two-Player Co-op Chaos: Team up for local or remote play together, synergizing or stealing loot in blood-soaked dungeons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade-Style Action: Pick-up-and-play controls deliver instant thrills for retro arcade fans.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ultra-Violent Combat: Obliterate skeletons, zombies, and more with gory, over-the-top kills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stat-Boost Upgrades: Buy speed, power, or durability boosts to customize your hero for the fight ahead.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >256-Color Pixel Art: Gritty, retro-inspired visuals bring vibrant, blood-drenched arenas to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punk Rock Soundtrack: A blistering score fuels every battle, amplifying the chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","developers":["Paradise Multimedia"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921270/46e9d0ceea236f30a962ea4b2f0270666e072513/header.jpg?t=1758569317","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/39212